      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Worton%2C_Maryland"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Museums of Kent County let visitors explore Worton’s heritage through the Waterman’s Museum and a virtual tour of the African American Schoolhouse.",
